<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN MONDAY SCHEDULE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN MONDAY SCHEDULE.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singles schedule on the show courts on the eighth day of the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Monday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Centre Court (2345 GMT Sunday start)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia)</p>
<p>15-Chanda Rubin (U.S.) v Dominique van Roost (Belgium)</p>
<p>10-Albert Costa (Spain) v 8-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa)</p>
<p>Night session (0800 GMT start)</p>
<p>Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) v 4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)</p>
<p>11-Jim Courier (U.S.) v 5-Thomas Muster (Austria)</p>
<p>Court One (Midnight GMT start)</p>
<p>3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) v Christian Ruud (Norway)</p>
<p>Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) v 14-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.)</p>
<p>Court Two (Midnight GMT start)</p>
<p>8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) v 9-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
